  <!-- T5-09: the read-only diagnostic.
       Builds the same portable sources the Linux runner builds for this suite,
       so the two paths cannot drift. The test binary is a standalone console
       executable on the dynamic CRT: no driver, no hardware, no administrator
       rights.

       The suite drives a full run through a real EcBus over the fake EC and
       asserts, from the bus's own write trace and the fake's committed-write
       log, that no register was written. It needs ec_protocol.cpp for that bus
       and ec_access.cpp for the configuration the bus validates and for the
       EcBusReader seam. -->
